  "question": {
    "text": "The magnetic moment of an octahedral homoleptic <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>II</mi><mo>)</mo></math> complex is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.9</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>.</mo></math> . The suitable ligand for this complex is:"
